          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಿರಿಧಾಮ — giridhāma — \"a hill station\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೇಸಿಗೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಗಿರಿಧಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ತಣ್ಣಗೆ ಇರುತ್ತದೆ. bēsigeyalli giridhāmadalli taṇṇage iruttade. In summer it is cool at a hill station."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಿರಿ, a hill, plus ಧಾಮ, a dwelling."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಿರಿಧಾಮ (giridhāma) is a modern compound built from Sanskrit words: giri, \"a rock, a mountain\" (CDIAL 4161), and dhāman, \"a dwelling place\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
