            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಪಸಾಗು — vāpasāgu — \"to get back; to return\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಯಾತ್ರೆ ಮುಗಿಸಿ ನಾವು ಮನೆಗೆ ವಾಪಸಾದೆವು. yātre mugisi nāvu manege vāpasādevu. After the pilgrimage we got back home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ವಾಪಸಾದೆ, vāpasāde."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಪಸ್, back, is common in speech: ವಾಪಸ್ ಕೊಡು, to give back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಪಸಾಗು (vāpasāgu) joins vāpas, \"back\", usually traced to Persian vāpas, \"back, returned\", through Hindustani, and the native verb ಆಗು, to become."
            }
          ]
        },
